 if these assumptions hold, the 'cost of inaction' is measured in the millions of lives lost to preventable disease, energy scarcity, and systemic inefficiency that only advanced AI can resolve. We choose between a future of rapid, iterative breakthroughs or a future of managed decline; there is no third path where we remain safe while we deliberately throttle the engine of our own evolution. 🚀",
